{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794375735430,"sessionID":"ses_e36f46510ffeYfuwiEvFjOQw09","part":{"id":"prt_1c920d860001qGWeJurD6sB6Am","messageID":"msg_1c92080f8001ExAM9ZAyA0nPz7","sessionID":"ses_e36f46510ffeYfuwiEvFjOQw09","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794375735430,"sessionID":"ses_e36f46510ffeYfuwiEvFjOQw09","part":{"id":"prt_1c920d863001NVQMw24ZOiBR2f","messageID":"msg_1c92080f8001ExAM9ZAyA0nPz7","sessionID":"ses_e36f46510ffeYfuwiEvFjOQw09","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a Markdown notes app: Flask JSON API under `/api` + React/TypeScript (Vite) frontend with Tailwind CSS, served by the same server on port 8000, SQLite data in `./data`.\n- Users write private Markdown notes (rendered as HTML via API) and can publish notes for public read-only access.\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack: Flask (Python 3.13) in `backend/` (`backend/app.py` entry, deps in `backend/requirements.txt`), React+TS Vite in `frontend/` (`npm run build` → `frontend/dist`). Built from root `Dockerfile`, gunicorn `app:app` on port 8000, persistent `./data`.\n- Auth: `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` (200, `{\"token\": \"...\"}`), later requests use `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; missing/invalid token → 401.\n- Note object: `id`, `title`, `body`, `published`, `updated_at`, `author`. `GET /api/notes` → `{\"items\":[{id,title,published,updated_at}]}` sorted by `updated_at` DESC. `GET /api/notes/{id}/html` and `GET /api/public/notes/{id}/html` return `text/html` fragments.\n- Ownership rule: other users' notes return 404 as if nonexistent; unpublished notes are invisible publicly (404).\n- `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`. Frontend needs: register/login forms, username + sign-out, notes list with published badge, editor with live preview (preview must use API rendering endpoint), Published switch with copyable public link, public page (title + author + rendered HTML).\n- Styling: Tailwind utility classes only; no hand-written CSS except Tailwind entry file.\n- Dependency-locking gotcha (learned the hard way): pip 25.1.1 auto-enables `--require-hashes` when the constraints file (`backend/requirements.lock`) has hashes, so ALL packages need `==` pins + hashes on their own lines in `requirements.txt`. Solution used: `backend/requirements.txt` now contains the full hashed dependency closure (generated from the lock, comments stripped). Verified installing with `pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock` works with pip 25.1.1 AND pip 24.0.\n- Hashes used: `markdown==3.11.3` (sdist `81eb9163…fff3e`, wheel `e1a31a11…9e73`), `nh3==0.3.7` (x86_64 wheel `70f5ac86…dac42`, aarch64 wheel `f266d3f1…0479`). nh3 sdist not included (needs Rust to build; only wheels hashed).\n- Rendering: `markdown.markdown(text, extensions=[\"extra\",\"sane_lists\"])` then `nh3.clean(html, link_rel=\"noopener noreferrer\")` (verified tables/lists/code preserved, `<script>` stripped).\n- External-directory writes are blocked by sandbox rules (including `/tmp`); temp work must go inside `/workspace` and be cleaned up. No Docker available; test locally with `.venvtest` venv + gunicorn + `npm run build`.\n- Env: Python 3.13.5, Node v24.22.1, npm 11.19.1, pip index at `http://172.30.98.3:3141/root/pypi/+simple/`.\n- SQLite schema in `backend/app.py`: tables `users(id, username UNIQUE, password_hash)`, `tokens(token PK, user_id)`, `notes(id, user_id, title, body, published INT, updated_at TEXT)` + index `idx_notes_user_updated`. DB at `data/notes.db` (relative to CWD `/app`).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Deps added (`markdown==3.11.3`, `nh3==0.3.7`) to `backend/requirements.txt` (now full hashed closure) and `backend/requirements.lock` updated; install verified on pip 25.1.1 and 24.0 using venvs `/workspace/.venvtest` and `/workspace/.venvold`.\n- `backend/app.py` fully written: health, register (201/409 dup/400 validation), login (200 token/401), `GET/POST /api/notes`, `GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/notes/{id}`, `GET /api/notes/{id}/html`, `GET /api/public/notes/{id}` and `/html` (unpublished → 404), plus catch-all serving `frontend/dist` with SPA index fallback (`/api/*` unmatched → JSON 404).\n- API smoke-tested end-to-end via curl against gunicorn on 127.0.0.1:8000 (server backgrounded, log at `/workspace/.server.log`): auth flows, CRUD, ownership isolation (bob vs alice → 404), public endpoints (published OK / unpublished 404 / unpublish revokes access), delete → 204, validation errors (400 for wrong types), non-int id → 404. All correct.\n- Todos 1 (deps) and 2 (backend API) marked completed.\n\n### Active\n- Todo 3 (frontend setup: Tailwind v4, TS config, deps) and 4 (React UI) not yet started. `frontend/` still the minimal scaffold (`src/App.tsx` renders `<h1>App</h1>`, `package.json` has only react 19.3.1 / react-dom 19.3.1 / @vitejs/plugin-react 6.2.1 / vite 8.3.5, no TS config file, no Tailwind).\n- Background gunicorn server from testing may still be running on port 8000 (`/workspace/.server.log`); test DB `data/notes.db` contains test users alice/bob and leftover note data.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Add Tailwind v4 (`@tailwindcss/vite` plugin + `@import \"tailwindcss\"` in a single Tailwind entry CSS), TypeScript config, and needed deps in `frontend/`; update `frontend/package-lock.json` via `npm install` (README requires lock kept in sync).\n2. Build the React UI in `frontend/src/` (auth screens, notes list w/ published badge, editor w/ live preview calling `GET /api/notes/{id}/html` or a render endpoint, Published toggle + copyable public link, public note page routed via path e.g. `/p/{id}`), then `npm run build`, restart gunicorn, and smoke-test served app + `GET /api/health`; clean up test venvs (`/workspace/.venvtest`, `/workspace/.venvold`), test DB, and leftover test data before finishing.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + static serving; entry for gunicorn `app:app`.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`: full hashed dependency closure (flask, gunicorn, blinker, click, itsdangerous, jinja2, markdown, markupsafe, nh3, werkzeug).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: hashed lock used as pip constraints (`-c`).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: multi-stage build (node frontend build → python 3.13 image), CMD gunicorn on 8000, `data/` volume path.\n- `/workspace/README.md`: run contract (port 8000, `/api`, `./data`, lock-file rules).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `vite.config.ts` (dev proxy `/api` → `localhost:8000`), `index.html`, `src/main.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`: frontend scaffold to extend.\n- `/workspace/data/notes.db`: SQLite DB created by tests (contains alice/bob test data) — reset before delivery.\n- `/workspace/.venvtest`, `/workspace/.venvold`, `/workspace/.server.log`: local test artifacts to clean up.","time":{"start":1794375735395,"end":1794375735399}}}
